keyAlone: "Plays the note on the selected track (27 keys, F3 to G5). On a DRUM track it plays the kit on the same keys at every octave; OCT changes how (ratchets up, SHORT/GHOST/FLAM down). On the DRUM grid (SEQ › STEPS) they are steps and lanes.",

